tasks.spec:
- New promo-hub.ts, the contract for ut, written into packs.md:
  liveNow(pool, ut, at) → LiveDrop[] {id, kind, title, accent, start, end, band, heroCardId, progress, isNew, boosted, cta};
  upcomingDrops(sport, at, n); launchDue(pool, ut, at); markLaunchSeen(ut, id) (ut.content.seenDrops, cap 200);
  calendarClaimables(pool, ut, day); claimCalendar(profile, pool, id, day, at), exactly once;
  calendarPassExtras(day, levels) for ut's Season Pass.
- New calendar-progress.ts:
  Check-in stamps = distinct Eastern days in the season with hq.days[d].games ≥ 1, capped at 10. Rewards from defaults.checkIn, claim cal:checkin:<season>:<n>; packs land as pending packs of existing kinds.
  Season Path counts games, wins and sbcs from hq.days. path-program counts wins with ≥3 current-program cards, recorded by extending content-progress.ts recordStandoutWin (already called from Match.tsx) into ut.content.progWins (additive). Claim cal:path:<season>:<pathId>.
- New ProgramHub.tsx and program-hub.css, view 'program':
  hero headliner card with countdown; released wave cards plus locked silhouettes with countdowns (never revealed early);
  packs with odds, BOOSTED and pity; SBCs with reward faces; the check-in card; Season Path with CLAIM;
  an optional objectives slot for ut.
- New PromoLaunch.tsx: a once-per-wave takeover with the accent, 'WAVE n IS LIVE', the headliner flip and the countdown. Static under reduced motion; focus trap.
- Hooks (~20 lines): the 'program' UtView, a nav.ts entry, the hub route, the launch mount and the claim callback.

- Challenges.tsx plus a new sbc-page.css:
  category tiles at the top (This Season, Standouts & Landmarks, Legend, Daily, This Week, Upgrades) with count, NEW, an amber marker for under 24 h left, and DONE;
  sticky chips; sections other than This Season and Daily start collapsed;
  reward previews with real card faces (UtCard w=56: the featured card for program/standout, the exact card for cardId and Legend), PackArt for packs, a chip for coins;
  sbc.ts nearlyDone(s, club) puts a '1 card away' chip on tiles and a Ready / 1-card-away row first.
- Final QA:
  typecheck, full npm test (3 sports) and npm run build once, all via heavy.sh;
  new scripts/packs/qa-packs.mjs walks Store → odds → confirm → open (levels 0–3 via fixtures) → management → Program Hub → takeover → stamps redeem → SBC page → submit with warning, in NBA, NFL and soccer at 393×852 (insets 59/34) and 320×568, aborting every non-localhost host except fonts;
  re-run packsim, promos, promoattrs and ladder with PACKSIM_LABEL=final.
- Finish packs.md: before/after, tests, protocol lines, touched outside my lane, owner device checks, the API contract, what is left undone. Update PACK-CINEMA.md, PULL-TRACKER.md and a UT-CONTENT-2.md addendum.

