Est 3 h, depends on packs-2, 4 and 5 and on ut's answer about the earned Spotlight routes.

(1) Stamps (D7):
- earning: 1 per 100 coins of the price paid, or of the store price for earned packs; 0 for Daily, picks, starter and admin-*; +10 for an already-owned special;
- stored ut.content.stamps {earned, spent};
- recovery floors: earned from pull-log entries since STAMPS_FROM; spent from stamps:<item>:<cost>:<uuid> claims, which withClaim pins at the end of claims;
- balance = max(earned, floor) − max(spent, floor); no back-pay;
- shelf, none sold for coins, each worth 5-12% of spend: 50 → 1 of 3 82+ gold; 120 → 1 of 3 85+ 'Stamp Scout'; 300 → 1 of 3 this week's Standouts; 600 → Program Pick;
- redeemStamps exactly once via awardPick; a minimal Store STAMPS section; sheet footer 'adds N stamps'; storeBadge stamps reason.

(2) Pity:
- no saved state; recomputed from the pull log;
- L(p) = max(13, ceil(3.9/p)) on the unboosted rate;
- forceProgram through pa.openOpts;
- oddsTable.effectiveProgram = p/(1−(1−p)^L), shown on the sheet and in the hub, never beside BUY.

(3) rankOf refines TIER_RANK: Hot Season 3.2, Honors 4.3, Finale 4.6. revealOrder and byValue use it.

(4) Ladder levers (NBA bands):
- Elite legend slot toward ~4.5% → Legend 40,000-55,000;
- weekly promo-paying SBCs keep paying re-rated Hot Season, fodder tuned → 15,000-26,000;
- Honors program odds ≤ 8% with pity and its guarantee ≥ 40,000, 1 per wave;
- Spotlight price = 1.5×max(Legend, Finale)/0.20, rounded up to 1,000 (expected 25-30k), 1/week via pa.canBuy in startPromo; reservations keep their price; SPOTLIGHT_RATES untouched.

(5) scripts/packs/ladder.ts: each rung in coins by cheapest coin route (pity, D10 fodder) and in days for engaged/casual players, including ut's earned routes.

Tests go in the stamps suite (+soccer) and the ladder suite (+soccer); pity in NBA/NFL.

